          "Initials": "M",
          "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "is an independent scientific consultant with Ashwell Associates, Hertfordshire, United Kingdom. She is a visiting research fellow at Oxford Brookes University, Oxford, United Kingdom. She has been a member of the Global Stevia Institute since 2011. She has worked previously as a research scientist for the Medical Research Council, as principal of the Good Housekeeping Institute, and as Science Director of the British Nutrition Foundation."}
